          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6 font-sans border-b pb-4">
            The Brush Kit Every DIY Painter Should Own
          </h2>
          <p>
            Rather than buying brushes one at a time as projects come up, most DIY painters benefit from assembling a complete brush kit that covers the typical range of residential painting work. Built thoughtfully, a complete kit costs about $80-100 and serves for years.
