            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I clean a paint brush properly?</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-700">Water-based: rinse under warm water working bristles with fingers until clear, then comb with a brush comb. Oil-based: rinse in mineral spirits, repeat with fresh spirits until clean, then wash with soap and water. Always dry with bristles aligned.</p>
            </div>
