              <h4 class="font-bold text-xl text-gray-900 mb-2">Are cheap paint brushes ever worth it?</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-700">For one-time disposable applications like applying paint stripper or rough primer, yes. For any finished work where the brush touches the visible surface, quality brushes pay for themselves in finish quality and longevity.</p>
